    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d66-a4">

                <pb facs="0180" n="74" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg74"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure C—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The commandant of La Libertad to Blanco
                    Trigueros</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Libertad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August 9,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>As the steamer <hi rendition="#italic">City of Panama</hi> has been confiscated,
                    it is hereby declared that there is no ground for the foregoing application.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carballo</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
